      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, I’ve come to a certain conclusion when\nit comes to Pokémon types.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s that Normal is the greatest type!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002000740068006100740020004E006F0072006D0061006C002000690073002000740068006500200067007200650061007400650073007400200074007900700065002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After all, Normal-type Pokémon have almost no\nweaknesses.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006600740065007200200061006C006C002C0020004E006F0072006D0061006C002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006800610076006500200061006C006D006F007300740020006E006F000A007700650061006B006E00650073007300650073002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Using Normal types basically sets you up to have\nan advantage against any other opponent!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve traveled all over this world and battled against\nall kinds of Pokémon, so I know what I’m saying.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How about I prove my theory to you in battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000610062006F0075007400200049002000700072006F007600650020006D00790020007400680065006F0072007900200074006F00200079006F007500200069006E00200062006100740074006C0065003F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When you’re ready to help me prove that I’m\nright, say the word.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F002000680065006C00700020006D0065002000700072006F0076006500200074006800610074002000492019006D000A00720069006700680074002C0020007300610079002000740068006500200077006F00720064002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m going to prove to you that Normal types are\nthe greatest of all. You ready for that?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020007200650061006400790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200079006500740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fine. You’ll need to prepare if you hope to win.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0065002E00200059006F00752019006C006C0020006E00650065006400200074006F0020007000720065007000610072006500200069006600200079006F007500200068006F0070006500200074006F002000770069006E002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon are all Normal-type Pokémon! They\nshould beat any other type you throw at them!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess it’s unavoidable that a Trainer has to care\nabout type matchups, after all...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you see...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200079006F00750020007300650065002E002E002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I just can’t remember them all! There are too\nmany types and combinations! It’s impossible!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, admit it. You haven’t memorized every\npossible type matchup either, have you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know them all by heart",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E006F00770020007400680065006D00200061006C006C0020006200790020006800650061007200740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um, well, not exactly...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006D002C002000770065006C006C002C0020006E006F0074002000650078006100630074006C0079002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then you really are one amazing Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E00200079006F00750020007200650061006C006C007900200061007200650020006F006E006500200061006D0061007A0069006E006700200054007200610069006E00650072002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s what I thought. None of us have!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020007700680061007400200049002000740068006F0075006700680074002E0020004E006F006E00650020006F006600200075007300200068006100760065002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I think I’ll stick with Normal types.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey may not be the greatest, but at least they’re\nadaptable to all kinds of situations!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though there is one type that Normal-type moves\nare completely ineffective against...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe dreaded Ghost type!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If only Normal-type moves worked on Ghost types\nthen my team would be ready for any opponent!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If only Normal-type moves worked against Ghost-\ntype Pokémon... *sigh*<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
